#: lib/tuist_web/live/docs_live.ex:692
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Run your continuous integration and continuous delivery automations on managed macOS and Linux runners."
msgstr "관리되는 macOS 및 Linux 러너에서 지속적 통합 및 지속적 전달 자동화를 실행하세요."

#: lib/tuist_web/live/docs_live.ex:196
#: lib/tuist_web/live/docs_live.ex:682
